Package: rrp
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python, ice-remoteio
Description: Round Robin Protocol
 RRP is a Round Robin protocol for RS-485 devices. It gives a quantum
 of time to each device to be able to send or receive data. It
 includes a Python version of the arbiter, and a library for Arduino.
